  "releaseNotes": "Parse-time nesting limit (128) with raw PARSE002 recovery, so parsing never returns a typed tree that rendering rejects; chains of any length stay typed; cancellable parse overloads. Fixes cast, pattern and is-expression parsing, edit indentation and newlines taken from source, and absolute decode-error offsets. CI gates unit and integration coverage at 100%. Known limitations are listed in the README.",
